    "metadata": {
      "title": "CNSSI 1253 LOW Impact Baseline (high-water-mark across CIA)",
      "version": "2022-07-29",
      "oscal-version": "1.1.2",
      "last-modified": "2026-05-01T00:59:43+00:00",
      "remarks": "Controls required for a National Security System where any CIA leg is rated LOW impact. Sourced from CNSSI 1253 Tables D-1 through D-20, rolled up to the highest-water-mark interpretation across confidentiality, integrity, and availability axes. The per-axis baselines (C-low, I-low, A-low) are preserved separately in cnssi-1253-axes.json."
